user default off
user ops on >ops-valkey-it ~* &* +@all
user trove on >trove-valkey-it resetkeys ~trove:* resetchannels &trove:* -@all +get +set +delifeq +incr +expire +multi +exec +publish +subscribe +unsubscribe +sunsubscribe +punsubscribe +discard +ping +hello +role +client|setname +client|setinfo
